Flight Status Tracker

Team Members: Navya Chowdary B (2620030093), Shanmuka Priya (2620030248)

1. Project Abstract

The Flight Status Tracker is a responsive web application that helps travellers quickly look up flight details and monitor journey updates through a clean, accessible interface. It combines intuitive search forms with clear visual status indicators. This reduces confusion around schedule changes and presents essential flight information in an easy-to-scan format.
Users can search by flight number, route or travel date. They can view real-time or scheduled flight status, such as on-time, delayed, boarding or landed. The results also show planned and actual departure and arrival times, airport details, terminal numbers and gate assignments.
Colour-coded badges and structured layouts highlight schedule adjustments immediately. This helps travellers, and those picking them up, plan airport arrivals and connections with greater confidence on both desktop and mobile devices.

2. Advantages

• Quick lookup: Finds flights by flight number, route or travel date.
• Clear status: Colour-coded badges make delays and other changes easy to spot.
• Information in one place: Shows times, airport details, terminals and gates together.
• Time comparison: Places planned and actual departure and arrival times side by side.
• Better planning: Helps users time airport arrivals, pick-ups and connections.
• Responsive design: Works across desktop and mobile devices.
• User-friendly interface: Presents information in a clean, easy-to-scan layout.

3. Implementation Details

• Flight Search: Provides search forms for flight number, route and travel date.
• Search Results: Displays the flights that match the search.
• Flight Status Display: Shows the real-time or scheduled status, such as on-time, delayed, boarding or landed.
• Status Indicators: Uses colour-coded badges with status labels to highlight changes.
• Schedule Details: Shows planned and actual departure and arrival times.
• Airport Information: Displays airport details, terminal numbers and gate assignments.
• Clear Navigation: Lets users move easily between search and flight information.
• Responsive Layout: Adjusts the interface to desktop and mobile screens.

