5. Conclusion

The Flight Status Tracker gives travellers a simple way to look up flights and follow journey updates in one web application. Its search forms, status badges and structured layouts make schedule changes easier to notice and understand.
The project demonstrates web-page structure, form-based search, information display and responsive design. A real deployment would need a reliable flight data source, proper error handling and regular data updates to keep the information accurate.

